## Required changes

- `aks-shop`: `zone-high-availability` (not offered by `Kubernetes Kapsule`)
- `disk-shop-web-1-data`: `encryption-at-rest` (not offered by `Block Storage`)
- `mysql-shop-catalog`: `point-in-time-restore` (not offered by `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL High Availability`)
- `psql-shop`: `point-in-time-restore`, `zone-high-availability` (not offered by `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL`)
- `vmss-shop-web`: `autoscaling`, `zone-high-availability` (not offered by `Instances`)

